{"tabData": ["1-50", "51-53"], "bookInfo": {"bookId": "42000024398", "bookName": "Llévame a casa", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024398/42000024398.jpg@w=360&h=640", "viewCount": 93143, "followCount": 6918, "introduction": "A los seis años, cuando su madre sale a comprar un pastel, Alberto es atropellado. Erico Herrero lo rescata y lo adopta, llevándolo a Nueva York. Veinte años después, heredero del Grupo Herrero, llega a Camlpe para un proyecto. Allí reencuentra a sus padres biológicos, que nunca cesaron de buscarlo. Descubre la verdad sobre su familia, rompe su compromiso con Elvira y logra la reunión con sus padres.", "chapterCount": 53, "labels": ["Family Bonds", "Lost Child"], "tags": ["Family Bonds", "Lost Child"], "typeTwoIds": [305, 303], "typeTwoNames": ["Director Ejecutivo", "Urbano"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 305, "name": "Director Ejecutivo", "replaceName": "director-ejecutivo"}, {"id": 303, "name": "Urbano", "replaceName": "urbano"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Director-Ejecutivo", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "Llévame-a-casa", "bookNameLower": "llévame-a-casa", "shelfTime": "2026-08-12 15:53:00", "firstShelfTime": "2026-08-12 15:53:00", "performerList": [{"performerId": "12190", "performerName": "Mario Silva", "performerFormatName": "Mario-Silva", "performerAvatar": "https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/0x9/12190/12190.jpg?time=1786516735270", "videoCount": 1}, {"performerId": "12029", "performerName": "Maude Bonanni", "performerFormatName": "Maude-Bonanni", "performerAvatar": "https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x2/12029/12029.jpg?time=1786516735386", "videoCount": 1}, {"performerId": "12225", "performerName": "Alex Mannone", "performerFormatName": "Alex-Mannone", "performerAvatar": "https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/5x2/12225/12225.jpg?time=1786516734898", "videoCount": 1}], "performerIdList": [12029, 12190, 12225]}, "recommends": [{"boo